<h2>5 · Record Your Walkthrough 🎥</h2>
<p>Take a video on a phone while your page runs. Talk like you are teaching someone new. Try to use these words: <strong>checkbox</strong>, <strong>checked</strong>, <strong>change</strong>, <strong>if / else</strong>, <strong>classList</strong>.</p>
<blockquote>
<ol>
<li>Show your page, then tick two boxes and read the count out loud.</li>
<li>Untick one box and say what the <code>else</code> part of your code just did.</li>
<li>Read your <code>chk4</code> listener out loud and say what each line does.</li>
<li>Say what would break if <code>chk4</code> read <code>chk1.checked</code> instead.</li>
</ol>
</blockquote>
